sequenceDiagram
    participant DAC as De-Identification Requester<br/>(DAC)
    participant MGR as De-ID Manager
    participant DI_P as De-Identifier<br/>(Preliminary)
    participant DI_A as De-Identifier<br/>(Advanced)

    Note over DAC,MGR: Study authorization and signed policy available
    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x1 Submit De-Identification Job (async)
    Note over MGR: Validate authorization and policy before acceptance
    Note over DAC,MGR: If admission fails, return a synchronous error and stop
    MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted, Content-Location job-url

    Note over MGR: Compile one plan per assigned ruleSet and payload set
    MGR->>DI_P: ITI-x3 Submit De-Identification Task (preliminary stage)
    Note over DI_P: Requested scoped pseudonymization
    DI_P-->>MGR: 202 Accepted, Content-Location preliminary-url

    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x4 GET job-url
    MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted (in progress, Retry-After)

    MGR->>DI_P: ITI-x7 GET preliminary-url
    DI_P-->>MGR: 200 OK (preliminary output and evidence)
    Note over MGR: Validate preliminary output before dispatch
    MGR->>DI_A: ITI-x3 Submit De-Identification Task (validated preliminary input)
    Note over DI_A: Requested record-level suppression<br/>and fixed generalization
    DI_A-->>MGR: 202 Accepted, Content-Location advanced-url

    MGR->>DI_A: ITI-x7 GET advanced-url
    DI_A-->>MGR: 200 OK (final task output and evidence)
    Note over MGR: Validate final output and recheck release authorization<br/>Record staged release Provenance
    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x4 GET job-url
    MGR-->>DAC: 200 OK (R4 Parameters with cohort and evidence)
    Note over DAC: Forward the released cohort to the SPE (outside DIS)
